    "expectedRule": "Chapter 15 keeps noise 0-6, starting at 0. The first clear of a monster or trap raises noise by 1 (no hushblade here). The first clear of a relay console (north, central, south) leaves a pending relay that blocks leaving with `广播中继尚未调谐，请先选择静默或播送。`; law/resolve-broadcast-relay mutes (-1, clamped at 0; no dead_air_headset) or broadcasts (+1 and 180 run reward points). Display: title 寂声广播律, status `噪声 n/6，北中继:x，中央中继:x，南中继:x，静默 m，播送 b[，待调谐 <relay>]，Boss快照 未冻结|k`; severity resolved once all relays are resolved or the boss froze, danger while pending or at noise 5+, warning at 3+, otherwise stable; meter {noise, 6}. Gates: broadcast_silent_archive_gate needs 2 mutes and noise <= 1, broadcast_memory_boss_gate (broadcast_memory_stage -> last_broadcaster) all relays resolved (`三座中继全部调谐后，末频道王门开放。`). Selecting the boss freezes bossNoiseSnapshot = noise (no last_channel_beacon); in the boss encounter a snapshot of 0/1/2 sets encounter defense to 12/8/4%. The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
